    <data key="d0">IHS Markit Virtual Software Training Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7LziNjUTo7w</data>
    <data key="d2">Automated deployment architecture for virtual training sessions using CloudFormation, AppStream 2.0, FSx, and RDS SQL Express.</data>
